```

TRY FIRST.

SOLUTION
1. `undefined`: `var x` hoisted, not yet assigned.
2. `6 11`: `var x = 6` overwrote the global `x`; block `let y` shadows outer `y`.
3. `6 10`: `x` was overwritten (var ignores blocks); outer `y` untouched.
